    "title": "Master GeoLocator Data Package",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.18187093",
    "publication_date": "2026-10",
    "description": "<h1>GeoLocator Master Data Package</h1>\n<p>The <span><strong>GeoLocator Master Data Package</strong></span> is an aggregated, community-curated dataset that brings together all <em>open-access</em> GeoLocator Data Packages published on the <a href=\"https://zenodo.org/communities/geolocator-dp/records?q=&amp;l=list&amp;p=1&amp;s=10\">GeoLocator Data Package community</a>. Its primary goal is to provide a single, easy-to-use entry point for researchers wishing to work across multiple projects, species, and regions, while preserving full provenance and attribution to the original data contributors.</p>\n<p>This master package is derived exclusively from project-level GeoLocator Data Packages and follows the same standardized data-exchange format. It is updated on a regular basis (typically once or twice per year), with each release representing a stable, citable snapshot of all eligible open-access contributions at that time.</p>",
    "access_right": "open",
