    "notes": "<h2>How to cite?</h2>\n<p>When using data from the GeoLocator Master Data Package, users should cite <span><strong>both</strong></span>:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p><strong>The master data package itself </strong>(Zenodo DOI for the specific version used).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span><strong>The associated data paper</strong></span> describing the GeoLocator Data Package framework and analysis pipeline</p>\n<p>(citation placeholder; to be updated upon publication)</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>In addition, users are strongly encouraged to cite the original project-level data packages relevant to their analyses, using the DOIs provided in <span>datapackages.csv</span>, to ensure appropriate credit to individual data contributors.</p>"
  },
